<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Your login code</title>
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <div style="margin: 0 auto; max-width: 500px;">
      <h2>Snippet Master login verification</h2>
      <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
      <p>Use this code to finish signing in. It expires in 10 minutes.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: 8px; font-weight: bold;">{{code}}</p>
      <p>If you did not try to sign in, change your password right away.</p>
      <p>Regards,<br /><b>Snippet Master</b> Team</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
